Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 17:41:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Aakar 8.12: UI style picker and merged workspaces

- UI picker (Classic / Studio / Graphite / Pro), remembered per machine
- 13 ribbon tabs merged into 9 workspaces with sub-tabs (Studio, Graphite, Pro)
- ViewCube for Graphite and Pro; viewport and body colours per style
- Classic keeps the 8.11.1 UI unchanged; original #ribbon kept hidden for compatibility

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MvLybUGZkdXhnZxC5CmdGQ
